OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPhil and Angie host at the Jolly
OL,7,     FCarter pub in Bolton. Despite
OL,8,     FAngie's nerves, the room
OL,9,     Finspections go well. But will
OL,10,     Ftheir guests be as keen on their
OL,11,     Froller disco entertainment?
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJohn hopes that the scaffolding
OL,14,     Foutside the Alexandra Hotel in
OL,15,     FLlandudno won't put off his
OL,16,     Fguests. But there are slip-ups
OL,17,     Fwith towels and teabags, and
OL,18,     FGloria gets locked in the loo.
